      "writtenOn": "2021-03-24T14:51:11Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Yes, I think we can streamline this a little. The problem is that overrides are always allowed for test-apks, even when on a release build. This whole logic lives in the OverrideValidatorImpl and is called further down the line. We should avoid duplicating that logic here.",
